  "_note": "List of (Q)EAA / Attestation Providers (EUDI ARF §Attestation Providers, shaped as an ETSI TS 119 602 LoTE). The mDL (ISO/IEC 18013-5) is an electronic attestation of attributes issued under the Attestation Issuer CA listed here. The list holds two kinds of entity, told apart by serviceTypeIdentifier: (1) providers the scheme itself certifies (http://uri.etsi.org/19602/SvcType/...), and (2) real-world mDL / ID-Pass issuing authority root certificates (IACAs) MIRRORED from their public sources so the sandbox can verify production credentials (.../svctype/.../mirrored-iaca). The scheme operator does NOT certify, audit or supervise a mirrored entity — it only republishes a certificate it observed. In a production ecosystem these belong in an ISO/IEC 18013-5 Annex C VICAL, not in a scheme LoTE.",
